<title>USA: Urban Outfitters Q4 may be lower than year ago.</title>
<headline>Urban Outfitters Q4 may be lower than year ago.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Urban Outfitters Inc said on Tuesday that it expects fourth quarter earnings will be below plan and possibly below last year's level.</p>
<p>The company reported that December same store sales declined 12 percent.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
